.IX Title "LTPCLO 1"
.TH LTPCLO 1 2025-11-26 "perl v5.38.2" "BP executables"
.\" For nroff, turn off justification.  Always turn off hyphenation; it makes
.\" way too many mistakes in technical documents.
.if n .ad l
.nh
.SH NAME
ltpclo \- LTP\-based BP convergence layer adapter output task
.SH SYNOPSIS
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
\&\fBltpclo\fR \fIremote_node_nbr\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
\&\fBltpclo\fR is a background "daemon" task that extracts bundles from the
queues of segments ready for transmission via LTP to the remote bundle
protocol agent identified by \fIremote_node_nbr\fR and passes them to the
local LTP engine for aggregation, segmentation, and transmission to the
remote node.
.PP
\&\fBltpclo\fR is spawned automatically by \fBbpadmin\fR in response to the 's' (START)
command that starts operation of the Bundle Protocol, and it is terminated by
\&\fBbpadmin\fR in response to an 'x' (STOP) command.  \fBltpclo\fR can also be
spawned and terminated in response to START and STOP commands that pertain
specifically to the LTP convergence layer protocol.
.SH "EXIT STATUS"
.IX Header "EXIT STATUS"
.IP """0""" 4
.IX Item """0"""
\&\fBltpclo\fR terminated normally, for reasons noted in the \fBion.log\fR file.  If
this termination was not commanded, investigate and solve the problem identified
in the log file and use \fBbpadmin\fR to restart the BRSC protocol.
.IP """1""" 4
.IX Item """1"""
\&\fBltpclo\fR terminated abnormally, for reasons noted in the \fBion.log\fR file.
Investigate and solve the problem identified in the log file, then use
\&\fBbpadmin\fR to restart the BRSC protocol.
.SH FILES
.IX Header "FILES"
No configuration files are needed.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.IX Header "ENVIRONMENT"
No environment variables apply.
.SH DIAGNOSTICS
.IX Header "DIAGNOSTICS"
The following diagnostics may be issued to the \fBion.log\fR log file:
.IP "ltpclo can't attach to BP." 4
.IX Item "ltpclo can't attach to BP."
\&\fBbpadmin\fR has not yet initialized Bundle Protocol operations.
.IP "No such ltp duct." 4
.IX Item "No such ltp duct."
No LTP outduct with duct name matching \fIremote_node_nbr\fR has been added
to the BP database.  Use \fBbpadmin\fR to stop the LTP convergence-layer
protocol, add the outduct, and then restart the LTP protocol.
.IP "CLO task is already started for this duct." 4
.IX Item "CLO task is already started for this duct."
Redundant initiation of \fBltpclo\fR.
.IP "ltpclo can't initialize LTP." 4
.IX Item "ltpclo can't initialize LTP."
\&\fBltpadmin\fR has not yet initialized LTP operations.
.SH BUGS
.IX Header "BUGS"
Report bugs to <https://github.com/nasa\-jpl/ION\-DTN/issues>
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.IX Header "SEE ALSO"
\&\fBbpadmin\fR\|(1), \fBbprc\fR\|(5), \fBltpadmin\fR\|(1), \fBltprc\fR\|(5), \fBltpcli\fR\|(1)
